<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-lauschke-ex-vivo-scaling-mPSM-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Lauschke, Tsiairis, François & Aulehla (2013) scale-invariant phase-gradient encoding in ex vivo monolayer presomitic mesoderm (mPSM) — MorphoEval overall 59.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2014-lauschke-ex-vivo-scaling-mPSM.py` (60.1/100). The initial baseline captures the linear segment scaling rule S_n = alpha * R(t_n) (alpha = 0.11) and geometric residual radius decay R_{n+1} = (1 - alpha) * R_n, but requires explicit multi-size explant phase-gradient collapse verification across R_0 in {150, 250, 350, 450} um, 2D circular LuVeLu target-wave kymograph synthesis, DAPT Notch-inhibition and constant-velocity non-scaling ablation controls, and bilateral paraxial somite segmentation on `mouse_mpsm_somites_specimen.jpg`. Overall 59.9/100 (faithfulness 58.1, reproducibility 64.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 64, Morphological realism / specimen match 54, Parameter expressivity 60, Morphometric validation 56, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 64. Output judged: docs/media/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM_comparison.png: rendered output of 2014-lauschke-ex-vivo-scaling-mPSM.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1543732 B, 2775×1650 px, artifact_sha256 70c6c4fba09b9551bf271149669608aefce7f5c02907731b21cc2e1f8b96a61e (sha256 70c6c4fba09b9551bf271149669608aefce7f5c02907731b21cc2e1f8b96a61e), spec_fingerprint 0664f71d3f534bae2179e8241d0641469c79bbe4d267f1da6ae7e8f684b90e69. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 0664f71d3f534bae2179e8241d0641469c79bbe4d267f1da6ae7e8f684b90e69; artifact_sha256: 70c6c4fba09b9551bf271149669608aefce7f5c02907731b21cc2e1f8b96a61e; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM_reference.json=4b43d8d8398b7653..., datasets/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM/mouse_mpsm_somites_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2..., datasets/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM/scout_manifest.json=ed97fcae27d8072b...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak segmentation on `datasets/ex_vivo_scaling_mPSM/mouse_mpsm_somites_specimen.jpg` with phase-aligned waveform correlation.",
        "remediation needed: Simulate the 2D circular mPSM target-wave LuVeLu kymograph alongside DAPT Notch-inhibition (0 segments) and constant-velocity non-scaling controls.",
        "remediation needed: Verify universal normalized phase-gradient collapse phi(r/R(t)) across all 4 explant sizes R_0 in {150, 250, 350, 450} um (collapse std < 1e-12 rad) vs non-scaling constant-gradient divergence." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.99e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

